  "notes": "Both images show the same artwork at different resolutions; each transcribed separately. Peripheral functions written as column header + printed instance number + signal (e.g. 'SPI1 CSn', 'PWM6 B', 'ADC3'). Silkscreen 5V/3V and A0-A3, 0-7 put first in functions. QW/ST labels (GND, 3V3, SDA, SCL) are printed callouts beneath the connector; SDA/SCL lead to faded GP12/GP13 callout rows. Skipped: RESET and BOOT/USER (GP23) buttons, LED R/G/B (GP18-GP20)."
